Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.88,0:18:08.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,快點 結果掉Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.33,0:18:13.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,虛蜢達...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.84,0:18:16.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是不懂得放棄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:20.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,弱小者不斷掙扎的醜態 真是礙眼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.16,0:18:23.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼評價都無所謂！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.91,0:18:28.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經堅定了覺悟 要拯救虛蜢達！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.28,0:18:33.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕對不會放棄的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.99,0:18:36.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.19,0:18:46.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,虛蜢達心靈的光芒？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.52,0:18:52.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了！不要消失！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.23,0:18:57.10,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我來...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.93,0:19:01.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,照亮你！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.68,0:19:05.51,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀吧！稜鏡虹光！
